    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Removes up to 99.8% of plaque<\/p><p>✔ Full-mouth 360° sonic cleaning in just 30 seconds<\/p><p>✔ Ultra-soft silicone mouthpiece, gentle on teeth<\/p><p>✔ Hands-free brushing with even quadrant coverage<\/p><p>✔ 3 Smart Modes: Deep Clean, Gentle Clean, Gum Massage<\/p><p>✔ Built-in memory, remembers your preferred setting<\/p><p>✔ IPX7 water-resistant, safe to rinse or use in the shower<\/p><p>✔ Fast charging and long-lasting battery (1+ week per charge)<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>1× 360° Sonic Electric U-Toothbrush<br\/><\/li><li>1× Charging Dock<br\/><\/li><li>1× USB Charging Cable<br\/><\/li><li>1× Attachment Head<br\/><\/li><li>1× User Manual<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "3442c9b0-dbb6-4dd7-b615-9313ba45f523": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Use?",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Apply:<\/strong> Add a small amount of toothpaste to the mouthpiece.<\/p><p><strong>Insert:<\/strong> Place the brush in your mouth, fitting it around your teeth.<\/p><p><strong>Bite:<\/strong> Gently bite down to hold it in place.<\/p><p><strong>Clean:<\/strong> Press the button, relax, and let it clean in 30 seconds.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p>✘ Do not force into tight spaces between teeth. <\/p><p>✔ Children require adult supervision.<\/p><p>✔ Please make sure to wash your mouth with warm water after use.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use the electric dental cleaning kit?",
            "icon": "washing",
            "row_content": "<p>1. Select your desired attachment based on your oral needs.<\/p><p>2. Turn on the device and alter between modes based on your cleaning needs.<\/p><p>3. Alter between heads if necessary.<\/p><p>4. Clean the device and the tip after use. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the different modes on the 360° U-Toothbrush and how do they work?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>The 360° U-Toothbrush offers <strong>2 dynamic brushing modes <\/strong>and a<strong> massage mode <\/strong>to suit your needs:<\/p><p><strong>Deep Clean:<\/strong> For a thorough, powerful clean that removes build-up and refreshes your entire mouth.<\/p><p><strong>Gentle Clean: <\/strong>A softer mode, ideal for sensitive teeth and gums, offering a gentle yet effective clean.<\/p><p><strong>Gum Massage: <\/strong>A soothing, massaging action designed to gently stimulate and care for your gums.<\/p><p>Switch between these modes easily to customise your brushing experience based on your preferences.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
